8-uax38-36-draft-pri483.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn3search4","snippet":"The majority of the content of the Unihan Database is released for each version of the Unicode Standard as a collection of Unihan data files","title":"UAX #44: Unicode Character Database","url":"https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr44/tr44-4.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn3search5","snippet":"> All files for the most up-to-date version of the Unicode Character Database can be found at: https://www.unicode.org/Public/UCD/latest/.","title":"Unicode Character Database","url":"https://www.unicode.org/ucd/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"unicode.org","ref_id":"turn3search6","snippet":"> Data for UAX #38: Unihan Database (Unihan.zip) ... > Unihan_Readings.txt","title":"Unicode 18.0.0","url":"https://unicode.org/versions/Unicode18.0.0/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"unicode.org","ref_id":"turn3search7","snippet":"> For access to the latest version of the data files that comprise the Unihan database, download and unzip the Unihan.zip file from the UCD","title":"Unihan Database Lookup","url":"https://unicode.org/charts/unihan.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"ocbaxtersagart.lsait.lsa.umich.edu","ref_id":"turn3search13","snippet":"38 | 3 | 好 | hǎo | xawX (x- + -aw B) | *qʰˤuʔ | good | 1044a | 21028.01 | U+597D ... 38","title":"Baxter-Sagart Old Chinese reconstruction, version 1.1 (13 September 2014)","url":"https://ocbaxtersagart.lsait.lsa.umich.edu/BaxterSagartOCbyRadStr2014-09-20.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn3search8","snippet":"https://www.unicode.org/Public/UCD/latest/ucd/Unihan.zip","title":"UAX #41: Common References for UAXs","url":"https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr41/tr41-37.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn3search9","snippet":"© 1991-Present Unicode, Inc. ... Image: [ ] | UCD.zip | 2020-03-09 18:33 | 7.2M |Image: [ ] | Unihan.zip | 2